WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:00.030
<b>Summary of previous episodes</b>

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:06.460
<i>Last time on </i>Frankenstein Family<i>:</i>

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:10.680
<i>It's hard to be a family of kids all alone.</i>

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.000
<i>So we need the help of an adult...</i>

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:21.040
<i>But how do you find out if 
you can trust someone or not?</i>

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:26.790
<i>The landlord took us out 
to get new furniture.</i>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:31.380
<i>He showed us the island 
and it was really fun,</i>

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:34.260
<i>but apparently, the furniture 
had already been sold...</i>

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:39.690
<i>When I saw how upset he looked about it,</i>

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:44.070
<i>I felt a little silly for doubting him.</i>

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:48.650
<i>But we can just pick up new 
furniture at the junk heap!</i>

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:51.850
<i>That's what we've always done, after all.</i>

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:23.210
<b>Frankenstein Family</b>

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:42.490
<b>#9: Nature</b>

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:01.790
I just ran out of the medicine he'd need.

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:04.470
I'd need to go to the mainland to get more,

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:06.340
but I'm a bit busy.

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:08.000
I'll go, then.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.000
What about your job?

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:13.270
I'll figure it out somehow.

00:03:15.970 --> 00:03:17.680
You're hopeless.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:20.970
Well, come along to the clinic with me.

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:22.060
All right.

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:26.970
Everyone, do exactly as 
I'm about to tell you.

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:29.020
