00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:44.620
How's Snow?

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:46.030
How'd it go?

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:49.040
It's not that bad, it's just...

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:53.850
The landlord's getting medicine, so I'm 
sure Snow will be better very soon!

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:55.950
Right? Right? Right?

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:02.010
The medicine won't get 
here until the weekend.

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:04.150
What is it?

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:10.020
I think there might be someone here on 
the island with medicine for this illness.

00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:16.020
You're heading out again? If you go 
alone, you'll get lost, you know.

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:23.460
Once Snow's better, he'll have to buy 
me lot of treats to make it up to me.

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:25.620
Then I'll go, too!

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:27.530
An outing is better with more people!

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:29.850
Ashisu-neesan!

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:32.410
You're awesome! Yeah!

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:34.530
Hey! Praise me, too!

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:37.830
I said I'd go first!

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:40.760
Aisuri-neesan is pretty great, too!

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:41.550
Darn it...

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:46.570
Well, watch the house, Suishi-chan!

00:04:46.570 --> 00:04:48.010
Don't worry.

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:51.500
She'd never leave the house anyway.

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:53.990
We'll be back as soon as we can. Let's go.

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:54.950
Sure.

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.160
