00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:53.040
Where's the medicine?

00:12:54.310 --> 00:12:58.040
If you guess right, I'll tell you right away.

00:13:09.090 --> 00:13:10.510
Why won't you speak?

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:14.170
