00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:16.770
Is that how you ask someone for a favor?

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:21.430
You're so impatient. Honestly...

00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:24.570
I'm leaving.

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:27.270
I don't like to waste time.

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:30.580
Are you sure?

00:13:37.510 --> 00:13:40.090
Someone needs you, don't they?

00:13:44.390 --> 00:13:45.920
I'll find it.

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:50.550
Congratulations.

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:00.060
You found me.

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:07.610
Enjoy!

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:09.610
Tanisu and the others 
came by my shop earlier.

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:15.120
You really don't remember me, do you?

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:22.620
The woman from back then.

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:25.630
You only just remembered?

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:31.220
I've seen a lot of children in my time, 
but I've never met a family like yours.

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:33.760
You came to meet me because 
you knew it was me?

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:38.700
Tanisu came to see me and Yu Kaito 
asked me to look after you.

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:42.150
You were logged in with his ID, you know?

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:45.000
I never thought this would happen.

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:47.800
The reason I wouldn't give it to anyone else

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:49.870
is because the ingredients are very precious.

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:52.940
Even endemic diseases can be cured.

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:56.310
Why did you give them to me?

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:59.830
Because you came to get it yourself.

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:02.790
You hate going outside, don't you?

00:15:03.810 --> 00:15:06.800
But here you are anyway.

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:10.490
You were beside yourself, 
racing against time, right?

00:15:13.110 --> 00:15:15.100
Well, go ahead and relax.

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:18.290
If he takes this, he'll get 
better within a few days.

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:22.270
But never do this again, okay?

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:26.280
It's dangerous for girls to go out 
to meet people they don't know.

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.030
Don't do it.

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:32.110
I wasn't in a hurry because Snow was sick.

00:15:34.340 --> 00:15:37.370
We need our brother.

00:15:39.670 --> 00:15:43.790
Because we're family.

