00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:01.080
I don't need anything too over-the-top.

00:17:58.610 --> 00:18:18.560
<b>If you were going to be modified, 
what power would you want?</b>

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:17.220
<b>Yu Kaito
Horie Kazuma</b>

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:03.520
But I do love cats.

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:09.120
So the ability to know what other animals 
are thinking, not necessarily just cats.

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:14.800
To be able to know what they're 
thinking and saying.

00:18:14.800 --> 00:18:18.280
To understand them. That kind of power.

00:18:18.640 --> 00:18:22.120
For instance, you see a cat on the roadside,

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:24.040
and you say "hello" to it,

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:26.630
and it says, "Hey, Kazuma-kun!

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:29.290
It might rain today! Don't 
forget an umbrella!"

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:31.610
Something like that would be fine.

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:35.460
The ability to talk to and
 communicate with animals.

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:38.300
Especially cats.

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:39.230
That'd be really nice.

00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:40.920
It would be exciting.

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:46.460
It's not possible, but if I could be 
modified, that's what I'd ask for.

00:18:46.460 --> 00:18:47.610
Please help me!

00:18:47.610 --> 00:18:48.300
Yes?

00:18:48.300 --> 00:18:50.100
Do you have a second choice?

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:51.400
A second choice?

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:55.470
Let's see... having wings, or 
an engine that would let me fly.

00:18:55.890 --> 00:18:58.320
I'd prefer something that looked stylish.

00:18:58.320 --> 00:19:02.510
What do you think? Some doctor 
out there, make it happen!

