00:19:27.720 --> 00:19:46.020
<b>If you were going to be modified, 
what power would you want?</b>

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:32.120
There's one that I definitely want.

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:45.690
<b>Sumire
Kubo Yurika</b>

00:19:32.120 --> 00:19:37.400
It's... the ability to drink and 
drink and never have a hangover!

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:39.330
That's an adult thing.

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:43.330
As I get older, I become more 
and more prone to hangovers.

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:48.360
I'd like to be able to drink all I want 
and not have it linger the next day.

00:19:48.360 --> 00:19:52.770
I'd like a body that can 
disperse that stress.

00:19:52.770 --> 00:19:56.520
That's my mature point of 
view on being modified.

00:19:56.520 --> 00:19:58.400
That would be great to have, I think.

00:19:58.400 --> 00:19:59.740
I'd drink all night, every night.

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:00.530
Yes.

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:03.530
I come from Nara Prefecture,

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:03.620
<b>What's your second choice for power?</b>

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:05.500
and I really love Nara,

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:09.610
so the ability to go back to Nara 
in a second whenever I want.

00:20:09.610 --> 00:20:11.000
Teleportation, right?

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:13.470
That's an ability I'd really like to have.

00:20:13.470 --> 00:20:16.610
Until they invent linear motors, 
it's just really far away.

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:19.070
So I want the ability to go home quick.

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:23.070
And that was Kubo Yurika, 
voice actress for Sumire!

