 2018's<i> Frankenstein Family</i> booth

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:42.800
What? The ability to point somewhere, 
and make grass grow there.

00:20:33.120 --> 00:21:33.170
<b>If you were going to be modified, 
what power would you want?</b>

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:46.370
And flowers and stuff.

00:20:46.370 --> 00:20:48.940
I want a beautiful power.

00:20:49.370 --> 00:20:50.450
Anything else?

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:51.600
Besides that?

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:56.060
The power to fly. I'd like the power to fly.

00:20:56.820 --> 00:20:59.890
I'd stand on the top of Tokyo Tower.

00:20:59.890 --> 00:21:03.600
I'd like to look down on Tokyo from there.

00:21:03.600 --> 00:21:05.510
Although I am acrophobic.

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:14.750
I sing, so the power to save the 
world with my song would be great.

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:17.030
The power to fly!

00:21:17.030 --> 00:21:20.170
I want to go on a trip by flying.

00:21:21.140 --> 00:21:23.090
Otherwise...

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:27.710
The ability to eat what I want forever.

00:21:28.810 --> 00:21:31.880
I want to eat all kinds of things.

00:21:33.410 --> 00:21:36.190
<b>Frankenstein Extras Extra</b>

00:21:33.410 --> 00:21:36.190
<b>We asked Namikawa-san! 
"What's the second power you'd want?"</b>

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:38.730
Everyone. Good evening.

00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:42.360
<b>Snow
Namikawa Daisuke</b>

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:42.360
And good day. I'm Namikawa Daisuke.

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:47.140
Well... to them, the way they 
are now is the real them.

00:21:42.710 --> 00:21:56.000
<b>Snow  17 years old, the oldest of the five siblings
He was fused with a white dog and can
 maintain human, canine, and half-dog forms.</b>

00:21:47.140 --> 00:21:52.370
If I couldn't become a dog, if you weren't 
a genius... you'd hate it, wouldn't you?

00:21:52.710 --> 00:21:54.600
It would be like something's missing.

00:21:54.600 --> 00:21:56.000
Is that it?

00:21:56.000 --> 00:22:02.680
The ability to endure anything if I can
 just hold out for five seconds.

00:21:56.330 --> 00:22:06.500
<b>If you were going to be modified, 
what power would you want?</b>

00:22:02.680 --> 00:22:04.870
That's a power I want.

00:22:04.870 --> 00:22:09.010
For instance, if I think I really 
want to eat some ramen,

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:11.290
and can hold it off five seconds,

00:22:11.290 --> 00:22:13.320
then I'm like, "Oh? Did I want to eat that?"

00:22:13.750 --> 00:22:16.350
The ability to do something like that.

00:22:16.820 --> 00:22:18.410
If I think, "Oh, I'm so sleepy!"

00:22:18.410 --> 00:22:19.780
then I restrain myself,

00:22:19.780 --> 00:22:22.170
and suddenly I'm like, "Oh? I'm not sleepy."

00:22:22.170 --> 00:22:24.520
That's a power I want.

00:22:24.520 --> 00:22:28.700
I think the viewers at home 
are probably thinking this,

00:22:28.700 --> 00:22:32.080
"You can do that anyway!" 
You probably think that.

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:34.760
But what do you think of this?

00:22:34.760 --> 00:22:38.960
If there was a 10,000 yen 
bill in front of you,

00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:40.000
you turn it in, right?

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:42.460
That's the right answer. 
You take it to the police.

00:22:42.460 --> 00:22:43.960
I'd do that, too.

00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:50.330
But you can do that, so why can't you 
hold back on buying 800 yen ramen?

00:22:51.030 --> 00:22:54.560
<b>Seriously!</b>

00:22:52.440 --> 00:22:54.560
Don't you agree?

00:22:54.560 --> 00:23:00.190
The power to resist your urges. 
I'd really like a power like that.

00:23:00.190 --> 00:23:07.210
If anyone can make that 
happen, please contact me.

00:23:01.540 --> 00:23:07.960
<b>Please do not contact him.</b>

00:23:07.210 --> 00:23:09.320
Make it happen with a button.

00:23:09.990 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:11.190 --> 00:23:13.660
<i>Snow-niisan has disappeared.</i>

00:23:13.660 --> 00:23:17.400
<i>He's gone on a rampage 
as a monster, apparently.</i>

00:23:17.400 --> 00:23:21.620
<i>I need to find him and help him 
before something terrible happens!</i>

00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:25.700
<i>Sumire-chan is close to Snow-niichan?</i>

00:23:25.700 --> 00:23:27.170
<i>Oh, no! You're in danger!</i>

00:23:27.590 --> 00:23:30.250
<i>You have to... run?</i>

00:23:30.250 --> 00:23:31.410
<i>Huh?</i>

00:23:31.410 --> 00:23:33.350
<i>You're kidding, right?</i>

00:23:34.310 --> 00:23:37.140
<i>Next time on </i>Frankenstein
 Family<i>: "Split."</i>

00:23:35.030 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>#10:  Split</b>

00:23:37.550 --> 00:23:38.970
<i>Catch it, okay?</i>
